Chapter: DeskVm
  cites Works chapter GopDesk
  cites Works chapter GopUsb
  cites Kernel chapter BitmapFont

 GopDesk takes its panel geometry from the Option A stub's handoff cells at
 0x8000, which only that stub writes. codex-vm publishes the same three
 numbers at GPA 0x7C4, 0x7C8 and 0x7E0 -- the offsets HorizontalResolution,
 VerticalResolution and PixelsPerScanLine occupy in a UEFI mode-info block,
 which is why the emulator chose them and why the `-uefi` path agrees -- and
 puts the framebuffer at 0xBF000000.

 We say:

Section: Handoff

  vm-fb-base : Integer = 3204448256
  vm-cell-w : Integer = 1988
  vm-cell-h : Integer = 1992
  vm-cell-stride : Integer = 2016

Section: Entry

  opening : [Device.Port, Device.Mmio] Integer
  opening =
    let w = peek-32 vm-cell-w 0
    in let h = peek-32 vm-cell-h 0
    in let stride = peek-32 vm-cell-stride 0
    in let font = cbf-init
    in act
      ri <- runtime-init 0
      att <- usb-attach
      desk-run vm-fb-base w h stride font (att.ua-kbd) (att.ua-mouse)
    end

